                "retweet_count": 87,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was great to meet with NIH Director Dr. Battacharya to discuss the NIH\u2019s role in the investigation of Anomalous Health Incidents, aka AHIs or the Havana Syndrome. Victims were denied medical care unless they joined a study pushed by the Intelligence Community. This is unacceptable! The IC used flawed, cherry-picked results to back an invalid assessment. These victims who have bravely served the United States all over the world deserve the TRUTH! Thankfully Dr. Battacharya and the Trump Administration are committed to transparency and want answers. As Chairman of the @HouseIntel Oversight and Investigations Subcommittee, we will keep fighting for these answers as we investigate AHIs!",
